# API errors

## Domain modules (signals, auth, QR admin, pulse)

Throw Nest HTTP exceptions: `BadRequestException`, `ConflictException`, `ForbiddenException`, `NotFoundException`, `UnauthorizedException`.

## Media / upload / audio / STT

Use stable machine codes via `fail()` (see `src/modules/audio/audio.service.ts`):

```typescript
export function fail(status: HttpStatus, code: string, message: string): never {
  throw new HttpException({ code, message }, status);
}

// fail(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND, 'CLIP_NOT_FOUND', 'Audio clip not found');
```

Do not invent ad-hoc envelopes. Match codes in `api/BACKEND_*_SPEC.md` when implementing those APIs.
